      <marc:subfield code="a">&quot;In this book, policy expert Colin S. Gray presents a clear and sophisticated argument that the United States is - and should continue to be - the world&apos;s guardian. The Sheriff: America&apos;s Defense of the New World Order sets forth a strategic analysis with nine basic themes as guides to where, when, and how America should be involved in international security affairs. Gray&apos;s constructive critique of recent trends in national security is comprehensive, rooting defense issues and prospective solutions in both U.S. national security policy and the emerging international security environment.&quot;</marc:subfield>
